apple-notes-mcp demonstrates accessing Apple Notes.app via AppleScript/JXA
on macOS. This repository reimplements a clean REST HTTP façade with
original TypeScript code; it does not copy the MCP server layer wholesale.

The layout of Notes' checklist data that src/notes/checklist.ts decodes is
the one apple-notes-mcp documents (src/utils/checklistParser.ts).

